In the "sets" list, after the entry of office-xlsx-contract (keep the list sorted by set name) add:

    {
      "command": "node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-xlsx-layout-audits.mjs --tree <dir with node_modules>",
      "fileCount": 1,
      "manifest": "office-xlsx-layout-audits/MANIFEST.json",
      "manifestSha256": "780a9fb66d6ecf73c1f113d2b6598c5357f2afb731008b4238abf64becbab741",
      "recorder": "benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-xlsx-layout-audits.mjs",
